WEBVTT

00:00:07.290 --> 00:00:08.310
Yes!

00:00:09.420 --> 00:00:10.790
Alright!

00:00:10.790 --> 00:00:11.940
Consecutive wins!

00:00:14.340 --> 00:00:18.440
ETU. Their first victory on home soil.

00:00:35.700 --> 00:00:39.720
My name is Youtarou Natsuki.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:45.470
I'll be rejoining ETU with immediate effect!

00:00:45.830 --> 00:00:48.510
You're working hard, aren't you?

00:00:48.510 --> 00:00:52.330
You even made it into the starting line-up! You pushed Sakai down the pecking order, right?

00:00:52.330 --> 00:00:53.730
You're really something!

00:00:57.210 --> 00:00:59.740
He's an optimist.

00:01:00.580 --> 00:01:05.000
So even if he's worried, others wouldn't know.

00:01:05.430 --> 00:01:12.250
Ever since Tatsumi became manager, he's been calling me a lot.

00:01:25.700 --> 00:01:27.470
S-See that?!

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:31.480
I thought he just got back from rehab!

00:01:33.130 --> 00:01:37.160
I'm screwed. Can I still retain my position?!

00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:26.280
Hey, you were too rash on that one, Sera!

00:04:28.190 --> 00:04:32.910
Dammit... And I thought I got that one right.

00:04:33.300 --> 00:04:36.860
I haven't got any good balls today.

00:04:38.680 --> 00:04:41.120
Only 30 minutes left?

00:04:42.670 --> 00:04:44.680
It's not easy to get past this guy.

00:04:46.050 --> 00:04:48.010
Keep a high line, defense!

00:04:50.530 --> 00:04:54.010
We've been playing for a while now, but Yokohama's focus haven't wavered.

00:04:54.620 --> 00:04:57.750
I was expecting them to tire out by now.

00:04:57.750 --> 00:05:04.020
Though Sera's working hard, the opponent's defense line is pretty high.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:09.340
What's more, they've completely contained Prince.

00:05:09.340 --> 00:05:13.030
They changed their formation just to shut him down.

00:05:13.840 --> 00:05:16.810
He can't touch the ball at all.

00:05:17.830 --> 00:05:21.700
Even during his playing days, Motoki's defensive capabilities have always been good.

00:05:23.960 --> 00:05:26.550
Though I always managed to run circles around him.

00:05:27.840 --> 00:05:30.850
I'm not going to lose to you, Tatsumi.

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:34.970
ETU's playmaker has always been Gino.

00:05:34.970 --> 00:05:37.810
Once we mark him out, your attacks will be significantly reduced.

00:05:39.100 --> 00:05:42.310
Although you have a lone forward in Sera,

00:05:42.940 --> 00:05:46.820
he has neither the height nor the ability to conjure something special.

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:57.330
We still need to be careful of attacks being launched from the back,

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:04.620
but if Gino is shut out, they won't be able to create chances.

00:06:05.210 --> 00:06:06.420
However...

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:18.970
When will those guys get thrown in?

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.400
He's totally lost interest.

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:26.370
Should we take him out?

00:06:26.370 --> 00:06:32.300
But then, he'll get annoyed and complain because he can't swallow his pride.

00:06:36.300 --> 00:06:39.670
ETU have won two league games in a row.

00:06:39.670 --> 00:06:44.710
It's obvious that Yokohama did their homework on ETU and tightened their defense.

00:06:45.460 --> 00:06:49.170
I guess a team will get analyzed more if they are doing well.

00:06:50.150 --> 00:06:53.130
ETU only had 5 shots at the goal since the game started.

00:06:54.050 --> 00:06:57.140
Sera and Akasaki each had a shot.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:04.620
Since the second half,

00:07:04.620 --> 00:07:09.040
Hotta has roughly been able to carry out Gino's job,

00:07:09.040 --> 00:07:11.990
but their attacks are lacking in variety.

00:07:12.530 --> 00:07:15.360
The reason for that is...

00:07:18.360 --> 00:07:20.990
Quickly! I have to pass it quickly!

00:07:25.700 --> 00:07:27.630
...that Tsubaki is playing badly.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:31.000
How inconsistent can he be?

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:33.220
How many mistakes have you been committing, Tsubaki?!

00:07:33.220 --> 00:07:34.760
Focus, focus!

00:07:36.060 --> 00:07:37.780
Ah, that...

00:07:39.080 --> 00:07:43.120
Um, Goro, that's the <i>amazing</i> Tsubaki you were talking about, right?

00:07:43.790 --> 00:07:46.650
Uhh... Well,

00:07:47.680 --> 00:07:50.780
Come on, show us your true self, Tsubaki.

00:07:50.780 --> 00:07:53.650
You were fantastic against Nagoya!

00:07:56.180 --> 00:07:57.450
Calm down, Tsubaki.

00:07:57.980 --> 00:08:00.030
We're not asking you to do something difficult.

00:08:00.780 --> 00:08:02.160
Y-Yes!

00:08:02.950 --> 00:08:07.420
I thought that he had learnt to handle pressure during the Nagoya game,

00:08:08.150 --> 00:08:10.360
but it seems otherwise.

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:14.670
The opponents are watching him, and the team has expectations...

00:08:14.950 --> 00:08:18.180
I guess a new kind of pressure is awaiting for him.

00:08:23.370 --> 00:08:28.260
He might have to fight that pressure forever.

00:08:32.120 --> 00:08:35.680
We still can't find a breakthrough.

00:08:36.040 --> 00:08:38.780
I have to calm down.

00:08:40.600 --> 00:08:46.450
This is the time for a real forward, an ace, to score a goal.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:49.460
I'll do it. I'll definitely do it!

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:57.570
Just watch, Natsu.

00:09:02.610 --> 00:09:05.220
H-He's gone...

00:09:07.310 --> 00:09:11.610
Manager, I'm all ready. I can go in at any time.

00:09:11.960 --> 00:09:14.730
I'm feeling good too! Really!

00:09:14.730 --> 00:09:17.360
When I'm on, you will be shocked too.

00:09:18.370 --> 00:09:22.360
Hey, you can beg me as many times as you want, Natsuki.

00:09:23.180 --> 00:09:25.240
But I will not let you play today.

00:09:27.100 --> 00:09:29.200
Why, manager?!

00:09:29.200 --> 00:09:29.950
If you put me on the bench, why not sub me in?!

00:09:29.950 --> 00:09:32.040
You're noisy, Natsuki!

00:09:32.040 --> 00:09:38.380
Say... Didn't you score a goal against Yokohama around this period of the game last year?

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:44.390
Their manager is a very meticulous person.

00:09:44.920 --> 00:09:50.390
So I thought I'd bench you to give him a sense of precaution.

00:09:51.310 --> 00:09:54.150
If you haven't noticed, he's been glancing at our area from time to time.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:10:01.520
That's why you're on the bench. To be honest, it's the <i>only</i> reason.

00:10:01.520 --> 00:10:03.310
The only reason?!

00:10:03.310 --> 00:10:05.030
Don't be so impatient, Natsuki.

00:10:05.640 --> 00:10:08.400
You're still not match-fit.

00:10:09.690 --> 00:10:14.420
But your injury has healed. That's enough for now.

00:10:16.380 --> 00:10:17.920
I promise you...

00:10:18.360 --> 00:10:22.300
I'll prepare a stage where you'll come back with a bang.

00:10:23.230 --> 00:10:25.160
Be patient and wait until then.

00:10:29.720 --> 00:10:30.830
Yes!

00:10:30.830 --> 00:10:32.060
You're too loud, Natsuki!

00:10:34.990 --> 00:10:39.680
He appears not to care about you, but he actually does...

00:10:40.070 --> 00:10:42.180
I don't quite get what he's doing,

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:49.930
but I guess I don't dislike Tatsumi either.

00:11:05.470 --> 00:11:07.090
Finally, a chance!

00:11:07.090 --> 00:11:08.600
Go, Kiyokawa!

00:11:08.870 --> 00:11:10.850
Kiyo, pass it to me!

00:11:17.320 --> 00:11:20.610
Damn, I was free!

00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:24.110
Alright, a corner. Move up, Sugie!

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:27.390
Man, I almost fell asleep.

00:11:28.030 --> 00:11:29.490
Mark your man!

00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:32.640
I'll mark Sugie; you take No. 20.

00:11:32.640 --> 00:11:33.590
Okay.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:38.630
Whatever. I know I can't win with my height.

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:41.250
I'll use my speed and rush in instead.

00:11:43.530 --> 00:11:46.880
Please make it a short one, Prince.

00:11:52.940 --> 00:11:53.760
Bring it...

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:57.660
It's long!

00:12:06.820 --> 00:12:08.700
Yes!

00:12:09.050 --> 00:12:11.260
Nice work, Murakoshi!

00:12:19.210 --> 00:12:22.670
You're amazing, Koshi! Nice goal!

00:12:27.180 --> 00:12:31.620
I... wasn't involved in the build-up to the goal at all!

00:12:46.510 --> 00:12:47.430
Hey, you!

00:12:49.540 --> 00:12:50.620
Sera!

00:12:58.220 --> 00:12:59.280
Good job.

00:12:59.280 --> 00:13:00.220
Thanks.

00:13:02.430 --> 00:13:04.480
I'm remaining upfield.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:07.300
There isn't much time left; let's hold on to the lead.

00:13:09.390 --> 00:13:10.580
Good job, Sera.

00:13:10.580 --> 00:13:11.300
Thanks.

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.310
Another game without a goal.

00:13:23.030 --> 00:13:27.570
It's embarrassing. I've played in eight games and only scored once.

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:32.330
I'm not contributing to the team at all!

00:13:38.750 --> 00:13:42.510
At this rate, I'll get benched sooner or later!

00:13:50.450 --> 00:13:54.280
Nice shot, Sakai. Pressurize them!

00:13:55.080 --> 00:13:59.930
Crap, crap, crap! I'm screwed!

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.410
Nice game!

00:14:05.410 --> 00:14:07.320
Great goal, Murakoshi.

00:14:07.650 --> 00:14:09.850
As expected of Mr ETU!

00:14:09.850 --> 00:14:12.320
Let's keep up the momentum.

00:14:12.710 --> 00:14:17.620
Let's win five in a row to make up for the five-game losing streak!

00:14:19.330 --> 00:14:23.460
Sera, score a goal next time!

00:14:30.870 --> 00:14:34.220
What's wrong, Sera? You look more timid than usual.

00:14:44.290 --> 00:14:48.800
You guys did well. We've now won three in a row.

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.740
You guys should feel more confident about yourselves.

00:14:51.280 --> 00:14:55.970
We didn't really cruise through today, but what matters is the result.

00:14:55.970 --> 00:14:57.990
The opponent was a tough one too.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:15:00.560
We'll review the game tomorrow.

00:15:00.560 --> 00:15:04.620
Get some rest for now... except for Tsubaki.

00:15:05.540 --> 00:15:07.590
You'll have an individual review now.

00:15:08.540 --> 00:15:10.130
Y-Yes.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:13.680
You've been singled out!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:17.000
Being scolded is the best, Tsubaki.

00:15:17.680 --> 00:15:21.770
Yeah, you should be glad that you weren't subbed off.

00:15:22.180 --> 00:15:27.760
Thanks to Baki, we blew up quite a few chances.

00:15:28.350 --> 00:15:30.930
Prince, that was too direct.

00:15:30.930 --> 00:15:33.280
Come on! Get a move on, Tsubaki!

00:15:34.640 --> 00:15:36.160
Y-Yes.

00:15:37.990 --> 00:15:43.290
I bet everyone feels the same way about me.

00:15:48.370 --> 00:15:51.670
Dammit! If only I'd scored back then...

00:15:52.880 --> 00:15:55.850
Tsubaki gets scolded because he's capable of doing amazing stuff,

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.180
so there are expectations,

00:15:59.930 --> 00:16:01.980
but I won't even be yelled at.

00:16:03.780 --> 00:16:05.810
I know why.

00:16:06.630 --> 00:16:11.940
Everyone's expecting the return of Natsu, the first-choice forward.

00:16:12.950 --> 00:16:17.940
And today, Sakai went in and took a nice shot.

00:16:19.290 --> 00:16:22.940
They must be expecting me to be benched again soon.

00:16:25.910 --> 00:16:29.410
What's up, Sera? You're dazing away!

00:16:29.410 --> 00:16:32.460
Are you a kid? Getting all sleepy like that...

00:16:33.540 --> 00:16:35.650
We just won!

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:38.340
Cheer, laugh, sing!

00:16:40.550 --> 00:16:43.350
What's with you, Natsu? Coming out of nowhere...

00:16:44.290 --> 00:16:46.230
We won three in a row... Three!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:51.230
He doesn't know how I feel...

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:56.850
When I'm back, I'll score goal after goal and extend our winning streak!

00:16:59.220 --> 00:17:01.260
What's with this guy?

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:03.610
Hey, Natsuki.

00:17:03.610 --> 00:17:04.610
Yes?

00:17:04.610 --> 00:17:07.370
Quit fooling around in the bus. You'll-

00:17:11.640 --> 00:17:13.940
What are you doing, Natsu?

00:17:14.480 --> 00:17:17.450
Natsuki, sit down or you'll hurt yourself again.

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:18.140
True!

00:17:25.540 --> 00:17:30.770
No. No, no, no! I don't want to lose...

00:17:31.820 --> 00:17:35.380
...to someone like him!

00:17:45.670 --> 00:17:48.920
I must score for our next game.

00:17:51.650 --> 00:17:54.610
But, will I still be starting?

00:18:06.230 --> 00:18:07.100
Huh?

00:18:08.850 --> 00:18:10.490
Oh yeah!

00:18:11.450 --> 00:18:12.310
Huh?

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.640
Is my starting position safe?

00:18:21.750 --> 00:18:25.870
This is the formation Shimizu's expected to use.

00:18:25.870 --> 00:18:29.870
Well, it's likely they'll use the same formation as they did for our last two meetings.

00:18:30.240 --> 00:18:35.610
Keep their strengths and style in mind before anticipating their moves.
<i>I want to start, I want to start, I want to start!</i>

00:18:36.730 --> 00:18:40.880
Natsu has gotten better, but it's uncertain if he'll actually play yet.

00:18:41.620 --> 00:18:43.630
So it's either Sakai or me.

00:18:44.010 --> 00:18:46.130
And today's starting line-up is...

00:18:47.240 --> 00:18:48.730
Goalkeeper: Dori.

00:18:48.730 --> 00:18:49.470
Yes.

00:18:49.820 --> 00:18:51.390
Defense: Ishihama.

00:18:51.390 --> 00:18:52.110
Yes.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:52.920
<i>Starter, starter, starter, starter!
Sugie.</i>

00:18:52.920 --> 00:18:53.570
Yes.

00:18:53.570 --> 00:18:54.190
Kuro.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:55.000
Yes.

00:18:55.000 --> 00:18:55.660
Kiyo.

00:18:55.660 --> 00:18:56.710
Yes.

00:18:56.710 --> 00:18:58.740
Midfield: Murakoshi.

00:18:58.740 --> 00:18:59.420
Yes.

00:18:59.420 --> 00:19:00.180
Tsubaki.

00:19:00.180 --> 00:19:00.930
Yes.

00:19:00.930 --> 00:19:01.710
Akasaki.

00:19:01.710 --> 00:19:02.470
Yes.

00:19:02.470 --> 00:19:03.260
Gino.

00:19:03.260 --> 00:19:03.280
Yes.

00:19:03.280 --> 00:19:04.110
<i>Come on, come on, come on.</i>

00:19:04.110 --> 00:19:04.750
Tanba.

00:19:04.750 --> 00:19:05.370
Yes.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.110
<i>Come on, come on, come on.</i>

00:19:06.110 --> 00:19:07.790
And as for the forward...

00:19:08.450 --> 00:19:09.240
Sera!

00:19:09.240 --> 00:19:10.100
Yes!

00:19:10.100 --> 00:19:10.970
Reserve: Sakai.

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:13.320
Yessssss!

00:19:13.320 --> 00:19:17.920
Yeah, I'll do it! I'll score today for sure!

00:19:28.760 --> 00:19:33.060
Don't let him pass! Kiyokawa, don't lose out in one-on-one situations!

00:19:33.980 --> 00:19:36.940
How long are they going to attack like this?!

00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.280
He's shooting!

00:19:43.470 --> 00:19:44.680
That was close.

00:19:44.680 --> 00:19:45.990
Nice save, Dori!

00:19:46.250 --> 00:19:47.620
Put it out for now, Kiyokawa!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:53.620
Man, how many times did they shoot already?

00:19:54.360 --> 00:19:56.590
Both the league and the cup match...

00:19:56.590 --> 00:20:02.630
Shimizu have already defeated us twice, so they're getting cocky.

00:20:03.300 --> 00:20:08.500
On the contrary, we're not moving fluidly, subconsciously thinking ourselves to be the inferior team.

00:20:10.240 --> 00:20:15.140
The losing mentality of a weak team is not that easy to forgo.

00:20:20.600 --> 00:20:25.400
We're so busy defending that I can't even think of scoring.

00:20:26.260 --> 00:20:27.440
Damn!

00:20:27.440 --> 00:20:30.030
Natsu isn't on the bench today.

00:20:30.480 --> 00:20:32.910
I don't want to lose to Sakai either.

00:20:33.680 --> 00:20:36.160
I must score today!

00:20:38.680 --> 00:20:39.870
Gino!

00:20:47.480 --> 00:20:49.690
That was dangerous.

00:20:49.690 --> 00:20:53.010
Sorry, Seri! I overhit that pass.

00:20:53.010 --> 00:20:56.020
Come on, catch up to it!

00:20:56.290 --> 00:20:57.280
Sera!

00:20:57.280 --> 00:20:58.580
A chance!

00:21:02.150 --> 00:21:04.150
That's so close.

00:21:04.440 --> 00:21:07.560
Damn, I almost caught up to it.

00:21:10.340 --> 00:21:11.930
Let's go, Sera!

00:21:11.930 --> 00:21:12.780
Nice run!

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:27.050
I need to concentrate. My chance will come soon.

00:21:27.790 --> 00:21:31.930
Then I'll seize that opportunity and score the winning goal.

00:21:39.410 --> 00:21:41.610
Their passes are getting slower.

00:21:41.610 --> 00:21:44.150
They're finally starting to tire.

00:21:47.320 --> 00:21:48.440
It's up to you!

00:21:50.610 --> 00:21:52.240
Great interception!

00:21:52.240 --> 00:21:53.880
Counter!

00:21:54.920 --> 00:21:57.660
What should I do? Should I pass it back to Prince?

00:22:00.410 --> 00:22:01.080
Sera!

00:22:03.080 --> 00:22:04.980
There it is! A nice pass.

00:22:06.070 --> 00:22:07.300
This is my chance!

00:22:07.810 --> 00:22:10.300
I'll make it count!

00:22:11.350 --> 00:22:12.680
He can reach it!

00:22:12.680 --> 00:22:13.930
Shoot!

00:22:15.730 --> 00:22:16.930
Here goes!

00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:32.970
Damn!

00:22:35.500 --> 00:22:36.580
Sera...

00:24:15.480 --> 00:24:17.070
How's Sera doing?

00:24:17.070 --> 00:24:19.800
He's always been noisy, eh?

00:24:19.800 --> 00:24:21.470
I won't lose out!

00:24:22.060 --> 00:24:24.680
It's a bit early, but I guess now's the time.

00:24:24.680 --> 00:24:28.340
Natsuki's return foreshadows an event.
